Package: linux-canva-web
Architecture: all
Depends: bash (>= 4), python3
Description: Brave Canva PWA setup and IBus diagnostic helper
 A small community helper that discovers an installed Canva PWA in
 Brave, creates a correctly grouped desktop launcher, and safely diagnoses
 common IBus keyboard-input failures. It contains no browser, account, or
 design data.
